{"4686600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death's Game", "steam_appid": 4686600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Moral Dilemma</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time has come, and Death is feeling generous. He offers you one final game to decide the fate of your soul. Collect cards and perfect a deck to battle with other players in a 1v1 card game with your very existence on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/e0c8b6ebbfaefc87c0d5eb6975f1f494.poster.avif?t=1781193602\" width=388 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/e0c8b6ebbfaefc87c0d5eb6975f1f494.webm?t=1781193602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/e0c8b6ebbfaefc87c0d5eb6975f1f494.mp4?t=1781193602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players gain access to starter decks, with Deck building opening up after the tutorial. Earn card packs from the base set and future sets as they are released</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/1f585ce5b9a951c767ff33fbab42996e.poster.avif?t=1781193602\" width=390 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/1f585ce5b9a951c767ff33fbab42996e.webm?t=1781193602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/1f585ce5b9a951c767ff33fbab42996e.mp4?t=1781193602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Modern Tabletop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tangible interactions with digital objects. Using Hand Tracking, cards can be drawn and held in hand. Body Tracking gives away body language and allows players to experience another layer for mind games and immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/22219bfeee3922ebe406567c38b58cf6.poster.avif?t=1781193602\" width=390 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/22219bfeee3922ebe406567c38b58cf6.webm?t=1781193602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/22219bfeee3922ebe406567c38b58cf6.mp4?t=1781193602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first person visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 card decks with deep strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Card Packs added monthly </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck and experiment to find your ultimate team composition </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Moral Dilemma</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time has come, and Death is feeling generous. He offers you one final game to decide the fate of your soul. Collect cards and perfect a deck to battle with other players in a 1v1 card game with your very existence on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686600/extras/e0c8b6ebbfaefc87c0d5eb6975f1f494.poster.avif?t=1781193602\" width=388 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/